## User Stories

### US-5.1: Create and maintain referee records

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** maintain referee records  
**So that** officials can be assigned to games  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Create a referee with all required details and verify that a unique RefID is assigned.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-5.2: View referees

**As a** data user  
**I want to** view referee details  
**So that** I can identify the officials available for games  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Open the referee list and verify that each referee's identifier and required details are displayed.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-5.3: Protect referee assignments

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** protect referee records that are assigned to games  
**So that** game records do not contain broken referee references  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Attempt to delete a referee assigned to a game and verify that deletion is prevented or assignments must be resolved first.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

